  "prefLabel": "Ph 1808.01 Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1808.01 Responsibilities. Persons subject to these rules shall comply with the following:\n\n(a) Perform all functions under the supervision of a licensed pharmacist who is physically on premises and holds an unrestricted license issued by the board;\n\n(b) All licensed advanced pharmacy technicians shall wear a name tag, identifying them as a “Licensed Advanced Pharmacy Technician”; and\n\n(c) All licensed advanced pharmacy technicians shall maintain national certification as a certified pharmacy technician.\n\nSource. #13463, eff 10-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
